      "description": "<p>This dataset was used in the KDD Cup 2018 forecasting competition.&nbsp;It contains long hourly time series representing the air quality levels in 59 stations in 2 cities: Beijing (35 stations) and London (24 stations) from 01/01/2017 to 31/03/2018.&nbsp;The air quality level is represented in multiple measurements such as PM2.5, PM10, NO2, CO, O3 and SO2.</p>\n\n<p>The dataset uploaded here contains 270 hourly time series which have been categorized using city, station name and air quality measurement.</p>",
